<title>POLAND: BIG FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.10 vs    3.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.10 vs    3.52</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.40 vs    8.48</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	30.67 vs   32.53</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 20.18 vs   27.85</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   20.18 vs   27.85</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 15.78 vs  119.07</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     158.41 vs  224.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
